     "@es": "**Muligvis** = posiblemente; **sikkert** = seguramente; **vist** = probablemente; **måske** = quizás: **Han har muligvis ret.** = Posiblemente tiene razón. **Hun kommer sikkert i morgen.** = Seguramente vendrá mañana.",
     "@en": "**Muligvis** = possibly; **sikkert** = surely; **vist** = probably; **måske** = perhaps: **Han har muligvis ret.** = Possibly right. **Hun kommer sikkert i morgen.** = He's probably coming tomorrow."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Van después del verbo conjugado en la frase principal.",
     "@en": "They go after the verb conjugated in the main sentence."
    }
   ]
  },
